*: They’d rather gie (''give'') a merchant school old boy with severe brain damage a job in nuclear engineering than gie a '''schemie''' wi (''with'') a Ph. D. a post as a cleaner in an abattoir. ''Merchant school'' refers to a number of independent schools in Edinburgh administered by the Merchant Company of Edinburgh.

